    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "E6iA2E",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9520,
      "name": "Part A · Design system",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light"
      },
      "width": 10032,
      "fill": "$canvas",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 56,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "lYv7z",
          "name": "Header",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pfOpX",
              "name": "Eyebrow",
              "fill": "$placeholder",
              "content": "DESIGN SYSTEM · TWO THEMES: OTTER (DEFAULT) AND MARGIN",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hHGJs",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$foreground",
              "content": "One design system, two themes",
              "fontFamily": "$font-reading",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": -1.2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "d2vjND",
              "name": "Description",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "A theme sets every token, not only colors: fonts, the radius scale, how pills are shaped, how overlays lift off the page. Everything above and the pages below are in Otter, the default. “Pages · Margin theme” (below them) is the same pages in Margin. In this file a theme is a variable axis beside light and dark: set theme on a frame to margin. In code it’s tokens.css’s html[data-design=\"margin\"] block, and a few margin: variants where a component differs.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "D6540",
          "name": "What changed",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 48,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Mj26G",
              "name": "Color",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "stroke": "$foreground",
              "strokeWidth": {
                "top": 1
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": [
                14,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JULJ9",
                  "name": "H",
                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "content": "Otter (default)",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-reading",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "PVKy0",
                  "name": "B",
                  "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Today’s look, unchanged: Inter, blue primary, a gray frame round the content, rounded 8–20px, overlays with a soft shadow and frosted glass.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "cDwcz",
              "name": "Type",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "stroke": "$foreground",
              "strokeWidth": {
                "top": 1
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": [
                14,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YySbp",
                  "name": "H",
                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "content": "Margin",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-reading",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r1VKE",
                  "name": "B",
                  "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Ink on paper: Geist for the interface, Newsreader (font-reading) for what you read, ink primary, the sidebar on the same paper, radii 2–8px, pills squared (radius-pill), overlays solid with an ink edge (overlay-edge) and no shadow. Vermilion only for today and an agent’s question.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "kCEzw",
