                  "id": "c4ib0x",
                  "name": "B",
                  "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Colors (light and dark), font-sans, font-mono, font-reading, radius-sm…3xl, radius-pill, overlay-edge, shadow-overlay, shadow-dialog, backdrop blur, glass. New tokens default to Otter’s values, so Otter is unchanged.",
